# loom's folders that stay on this machine: its state here, what it can make again, and the agents' scratch. Everything else here travels with the quilt, to commit like any file of yours: the records, the library, and the agents' instructions, sessions and copies. `loom upgrade` rewrites the lines above the last.
/local/
/cache/
/agents/scratch/
# your own lines go below this one; loom upgrade keeps them
